00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:28.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Xi Jinping, à l'aube de ses

00:00:25.266 --> 00:00:29.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
70 ans, devrait se voir accorder

00:00:26.766 --> 00:00:31.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
